+        <li pn="section-6-2.7" derivedCounter="7)">Mobile nodes discovering that their current foreign agent had
+rebooted and therefore re-registering with that foreign agent.</li>
+        <li pn="section-6-2.8" derivedCounter="8)">The required form of tunneling (IP-in-IP encapsulation
+<xref target="MIP-IPinIP" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="MIP-IPinIP"/>) as well as the one of the optional forms of tunneling;
+namely, Minimal Encapsulation <xref target="MIP-MINENC" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="MIP-MINENC"/>.</li>
+        <li pn="section-6-2.9" derivedCounter="9)">Mobile nodes de-registering upon returning to their home network.</li>
+        <li pn="section-6-2.10" derivedCounter="10)">Registrations being rejected for authentication failures,
